module mistake_context .
rem expect: E-PIPE-CONTEXT-TYPE

rem ko: ✘ 문맥은 참조 없는 값이다 --- 슬라이스는 주소를 들고 다니므로 문맥이 될 수 없다 /// en: ✘ a context is a value without references --- a slice carries an address, so it cannot be one
fn over input x u8 . input s slice u8 . output bool .
do
  return gt x. idx s. 0 . . .
end .

export fn count_over input xs slice u8 . output u64 .
do
  return pipe xs. do
    filter over with xs. .
    count .
  end . .
end .
